Monks are able to utilize their chi manipulation powers to set
a weapon to vibrating at such a high intensity, it becomes able
pierce through the strongest of armours. The downside of this 
is the weapon will literally shake itself apart after an amount
of time.

|WKBThis is a Master of Winter power.

